<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S9.SS4" title="In 9 Supplementary Materials ‣ CEHR-GPT: A Scalable Multi-Task Foundation Model for Electronic Health Records" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9.4 </span>Zero Shot Prediction Setup</span></a></li>
