<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S9.T12.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 12</span>: </span><span id="S9.T12.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance metrics of baseline models for patient outcome and new diagnosis predictions using the <span id="S9.T12.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">ehrshot</span> dataset. This table summarizes both individual and average model performance across tasks. Abbreviations: LR (Logistic Regression), RF (Random Forest), GBM (Gradient Boosting Machine).</span></figcaption>
